{{Navbar-Global Gas Infrastructure Tracker}}
'''Agua Blanca Pipeline''' is an operating natural gas pipeline in Texas, USA. An expansion of the pipeline entered service in January 2021.<ref name=napipe>[https://napipelines.com/agua-blanca-pipeline-expansion/ Agua Blanca Pipeline Expansion in Service Ahead of Schedule], North American Oil and Gas Pipelines, Jan. 28, 2021</ref>

==Location==
The pipeline system services Culberson, Loving, Pecos, Reeves, Ward, and Winkler counties in Texas, including multiple deliveries to the Waha, Texas hub.<ref name=source1>[https://www.pipelinesinternational.com/2019/11/15/major-expansion-for-agua-blanca-system/ Major expansion for Agua Blanca System], Pipelines International, Nov. 15, 2019, accessed Aug. 25, 2021.</ref>

